			"Message": "refactor(Land): Advance Element submodule to 9ea79767\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to pull in a coordinated refactor across five submodules that consolidates Mountain's Tauri bundle layout and normalises indentation conventions.\n\nMountain restructures bundle resources under a canonical Static/Application/ prefix, unifying the flat bundle layout (Contents/Resources/extensions) with the monorepo dev layout (Sky/Target/Static/Application/extensions). The tauri.conf.json remaps all resource entries, sets frontendDist to null for dev-server delegation, and LocalhostPlugin.rs gains static_root resolution that probes both production and dev bundle paths. ScanPathConfigure.rs registers the new canonical path before legacy flat fallbacks.\n\nCocoon, Output, Wind, and Worker align their ESBuild configuration files and compiled artifacts to project-wide tab-based indentation, trailing commas, import-before-declaration ordering, and consolidated export blocks.\n\nZero functional changes across the five submodules — flat-path fallbacks in Mountain preserve existing dev environments and CI compatibility during the migration.",
